{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- Treat `get_window_state` as an expensive point-in-time snapshot. Capture a new state when you need to verify progress or when focus, layout, modality, or element indexes may have changed."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- Element indexes are valid only for the accessibility state that produced them. Refresh accessibility state after any action that may change the visible element tree."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- By default, `get_window_state({ window })` captures and automatically displays a screenshot, and returns `accessibility: null`. This is the best default for desktop apps with weak accessibility trees."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- If you need accessibility text or element indexes, call `get_window_state({ window, include_screenshot: false, include_text: true })`. Request both only when you truly need both the screenshot and accessibility text for the next decision."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326763}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- Important accessibility context is also extracted as structured fields: `focused_element`, `selected_text`, `selected_elements`, and `document_text`."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326764}
