{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "`, `Numpad_Subtract`, `Numpad_Multiply`, `Numpad_Divide`, `Numpad_Decimal`, and `Numpad_Enter` are also supported. For shifted punctuation shortcuts, include `Shift`, for example `Control_L+Shift_L+period` for Ctrl+Shift+`.` / `>`.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326764}
