{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "\r\n- Do not automate Windows security or anti-malware apps.\r\n- Do not automate the ChatGPT desktop app UI or Codex CLI or Codex extensions within Windows apps.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326770}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- Do not change Windows security settings, Windows privacy settings, or any in-app security or privacy settings. Do not act on security or privacy permission requests.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326770}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa1a-ed50-7d30-9362-86e66eae8ca7", "turnId": "01a1aa1a-edc1-75e0-85bb-1a0f6190b3b5", "itemId": "exec-3f3d4cc7-abd3-4713-965a-1283acab44b1", "delta": "- Do not use the Windows key or shortcuts involving the Windows key. Never call `press_key` with `Meta`, `Windows`, `Win`, `WIN+...`, `Windows+...`, `WINDOWS+...`, `Meta+...`, `Cmd`, `Command`, `Super`, or `OS` key names."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855326770}
